  "description": "EQICUF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H116 Co1 Dy6 O38 1+,3(C1 H4 O1),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.407-3.774 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.04-106.15°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [CoDy6(OH)8(o-tol)12(MeOH)5(NO3)]·4MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
